    explanation: [{ title: `Identify`, content: `Use the inverse fourth-power law.` }, { title: `Model`, content: `For the ratio, invert the wavelength ratio because intensity is inverse to wavelength fourth power.` }, { title: `Apply`, content: `$I_1/I_2=(650/450)^4$.` }, { title: `Check`, content: `This gives approximately $4.35$.` }, { title: `Conclusion`, content: `Therefore the shorter wavelength is scattered by that factor more strongly.` }],
