  "questionText": "Electricity revision focus — 08 advanced network reasoning: Reverse-check variant: A $12\\,\\Omega$ resistor and a $6\\,\\Omega$ resistor are connected in parallel across $18\\,\\text{V}$. Determine current in the $12\\,\\Omega$ branch.",
